{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんでーすヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/06/12/8020820/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、12枚目の制作や、初森ベマーズ、雑誌の撮影などなど沢山充実させて頂いています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/06/12/8020820/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演情報は、乃木坂46の公式サイトをチェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nogizaka46.com/smph/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☝︎クリック♪クリック♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/06/12/8020820/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FINE BOYSさんで今回クールにモードな感じに撮って頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/06/12/8020820/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、生駒ちゃんって写真に写ってる時変わるよな〜笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現実とのギャップが激しくて、握手会で引いちゃうの分かります笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はこんなルックスでいつも居たいんだけどね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/06/12/8020820/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは今回表紙をさせて頂きましたBOMBさんのオフショット〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"